.SH Notes

The member types iterator and const_iterator may be aliases to the same type. This means
defining a pair of function overloads using the two types as parameter types may violate
the One Definition Rule. Since iterator is convertible to const_iterator, a single
function with a const_iterator as parameter type will work instead.

